{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"No? Why not? What are you hiding?","O-oh no -- oh no, you won't show me? Why won't you show me?","Calm down- don't be offended, I'm just scared!","You're making me nervous -- please, please just show me","No? Then stay back, please, stay back","I don't understand, why would you refuse?","Please... just a quick look, a quick one!","You can't blame me for asking","I'm sorry, but I can't be near someone who won't show me!!","Then I'm keeping my distance, that's all","That doesn't help your case, you know","Maybe you're right... maybe I'm paranoid -- but still","It makes me uneasy, I'm sorry","Alright, I won't push, but I won't come closer either","God... I hope you're not hiding something","I'd rather not, if you don't mind, I'd rather keep them covered","No, please, I just... I'd rather not"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Then you don't come near us... simple as that..","Your choice, and my choice is distance","I don't take chances, and you're a chance","Fine, then keep walking","No sleeves... no entry..","That tells me what I need to know","Understood, but you're not welcome here","I can't help you... and I won't be helped..","No explanation needed, no company either","Suit yourself, but you stay over there","Not a problem, stay put","Hmph, I thought as much","Fine, but I'm watching you","You've made your point, and I've made mine","Sorry, but I'm not taking the risk","No, I don't have to, and I won't","Nope, you take my word or you don't"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to offend you!!","I trust you, but I had to ask, please understand","No pressure, I believe you","Okay, I'll take your word, but please be honest with me","I don't want to fight, I just want to be safe"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Then back off, now","No arms -- NO talk","That's it, I'm done, step away","Refuse? Then leave"}},
