{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, okay, okay, I hope you'll be safe out there","Are you sure? It's awfully dangerous at night","No? Alright, but please be careful","I understand, I do, you've got your own plans","I'm worried, but I won't STOP you","O- okay, then, take care, take such good care","You're brave... braver than me","I hope you find a good place","I-if you change your mind -- we'll be here","Fine, but be QUIET out there, please","That's your choice, and I respect it","Alright, bye then","I'll light a candle for you","Then keep out of sight out there","I wish you'd reconsider","Oh... yeah, no, I get it, go careful","Alright, but if you change your mind, you know where we are","Oh, okay, okay, I understand, I'll find somewhere else","That's fine, I get it, sorry I asked"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Your choice, but it's a risky night","Suit yourself, but don't come knocking at three in the morning","Alright, you know the dangers","Understood, no hard feelings","Fine, stay out there with the rest of the night","It's your funeral, as they say","I won't beg","Suit yourself then","You'll regret it, but go on","That's a gamble, but it's yours to make","Alright, find shelter somewhere","Take care, and keep low","Fine, fine, it's your call...","Fair enough","I'll sleep under a bush, as usual","No hard feelings, safe night to you"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Sleep in the street then, see how long you last"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I'll worry about you all night, you know","Be careful, my friend, be careful","The offer stands, any hour","Take care -- and come back if you need to!!","I understand, but my door's always open"}},
