{"TELL_MORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, okay, I understand, it's a lot!","Sorry, sorry, I ramble when I'm nervous","Alright, I'll stop, I'll stop!","That's fine, I wasn't sure I wanted to either","Okay, no more, I promise","I didn't mean to bore you","Right, never mind then","It's okay, it was a lot anyway","Maybe another time, if you want","Sorry, I got carried away","Yeah, sure","I'll keep it to myself, then","Alright, I'll hush","Thanks for hearing me out this far","N-no worries -- I'll let it go","Okay, thank you, I didn't really want to, honestly","You're right, it's better not to dwell"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fine, enough said","Then that's all you get","Your loss, then, I'll be fine without you","No skin off my back","Alright, subject closed","That's fine, I don't love talking either","Good, I've said too much already","Your loss, but okay","Let's leave it there","Okay -- understood","No skin off my nose","I'll spare you the rest","Alright, moving on...","You'll never know, then","Enough talk, then","Good, I'd rather not relive it","Yeah, some stories are better left half-told"}},
