{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, alright, I understand, I can't blame you","N-no? Okay... that's fine, I'll make do","O- okay, sorry, sorry for asking","That's alright... we'll figure it out -- somehow","I thought you might, but I had to try","O-oh well... I tried, I really tried","Noooo problem, I'm not upset, just a little worried!!","Yeah, I'd say no too","Okay -- thanks anyway, thank you for hearing me out","I get it, trust's hard these days","Right, never mind, forget I asked","No worries, none at all!!","I- it's alright, I'll look elsewhere","Thanks for not lying about it","I'll think of something else","That's alright... honestly I'd probably say no too","No, no, that's fine, I'm just glad somebody talked to me","No? Oh, okay, well, maybe another time, if we're both still around","Your call, no pressure, watch yourself out there","No? That's fine, it was a weird offer anyway","Right, sorry, no problem, I just thought... never mind"}},
